    "detailed_description": "<strong>VR2: Vacate 2 Rooms</strong> is an Escape the Room game. <br>It's the next experience after VR: Vacate the Room<br><br>Can you find your way out of the different rooms? <br>You need to find a lot of hidden items. Uncover secrets. Use strange mechanisms to proceed through the different rooms to the exit.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Please notice:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple Rooms but no(!) cheap teleporting<br></li><li>There are at least two rooms!<br></li><li>There might be a secret ending!<br></li><li>A VR room size of at least 2.1m to 1.6m is recommended, more would be even better.<br></li><li>Please make sure that you can reach at least a height of 1.75 meters.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hotkeys:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>F5 - Restart Game<br></li><li>1 - Low Quality<br></li><li>2 - Mid Quality<br></li><li>3 - High Quality<br></li><li>4 - Very High Quality<br></li><li>0 - Auto Quality (not recommended)</li></ul>",
